            <ArticleTitle>Are there fakes and frauds in your nebulizer?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>15-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>As patient advocates and educators, Allergy and Asthma Network Mothers of Asthmatics is concerned with the safety and quality of respiratory medications in our country. As such, we've formed CHASM, the Consumer Health Alliance for Safe Medications. This is the first in a series of articles looking at this topic.</AbstractText>
